  "notes": "This is the third Neural Networks video on backpropagation intuition. Major issues: NetworkScene and related neural network mobjects don't exist in CE. PreviewLearning and its subclasses are GL-specific. PiCreature API differs significantly. Helper functions need custom implementation. ImageMobject with pixel_array manipulation may work but needs testing. ContinualEdgeUpdate custom updater needs reimplementation with ValueTracker. ChangingDecimal, Swap, and ShowPassingFlash need custom implementation. The intuitive walkthrough of backpropagation is central - showing how errors propagate backward through the network. The 'fire together, wire together' analogy and the grid visualization of averaging over training examples are key visual elements that need careful implementation."
